    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiro kya kashatu Esita ajwara emyendoye y'obukama, ayemelera nyakabuga y'ekikaare ey'omunda, ayolekeire nyaruju mwonene. Omukama akaba abandaire omu nketoye omu kikaare alebire nyarulembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo yaboine Esita muk'Omukama ayemeleire nyakabuga, ashemelerwa, amwimukiza enkoni y'ezahabu y'obukama eyo yabaire akwete. Aho Esita agenda, akora enkoni y'obukama aha mutwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama amubaza ati, “Noyendaki Esita muk'Omukama? Noyetagaki? Ndakikuha; nangu n'orwo yakuba nusu y'engoma yange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esita agamba ati, “Omukama asinge kir'eki aije na Hamani aha mwegaguro ogwo natekatekera Omukama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Omukama agamba ati, “Yanguha mulete Hamani, tukore okwo Esita yayenda.” Kityo Omukama na Hamani bagya aha mwegaguro ogwo Esita yabaire atekatekire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kababaire nibanywa edivai Omukama abaza Esita ati, “Noyetagaki? Ndakikuha. Noshabaki? Nangu n'orwo yakuba nusu y'engoma yange ngikuha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Esita agamba ati, “Ekyo ndikushaba mara ekyo ndikwenda niky'eki: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama ansingire angiliire ekyo ndikushaba, ankolere ekyo ndikwenda, osinge ogaruke na Hamani nyenkya aha mwegaguro ogwo ndabatekatekera. Kandi bukeire ndahorora eky'Omukama yambaza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo Hamani agenda n'ebyera n'amashemelerwa. Kyonkai kayaboine Moridekai aha kihigi ky'Omukama okwo tiyafa gemelera handiki kumutina, amunigalira muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayemililiza, agya omuka. Atumaho banywanyibe na mukaziwe Zereshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatondera eitungalye lyona, abatondera orubara rw'abatabani, n'ekitinwa kyona eky'Omukama yamutungire akamukuza kushaga abarangira n'abaramatabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayongeraho ati, “Nangu na Esita muk'Omukama tiyaraliza muntu wena wena kugenda na mukama aha mwegaguro ogwo yaba atekatekire shana inye. Kwakwo na nyenkya yandaliza n'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai ebi byona tibilikungasha kantu orwo nkyabona Moridekai Omuyahudi ashuntamire aha kihigi ky'Omukama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Zereshi mukaziwe na banywanyibe bamugambira bati, “Bakore ekitanzi ky'oburai bw'emita 22. Iwe kaburakya ogambire Omukama aragiire bakihanikeho Moridekai oshube ogende n'Omukama aha mwegaguro noshemelerwa.” Entegeka egi eshemelera Hamani. Aragira kabakora ekitanzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
